<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank-not worried if Sweden not in EMU launch.</title>
<headline>Riksbank-not worried if Sweden not in EMU launch.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The deputy governor of Sweden's central bank said on Thursday he was not worried if Sweden chose to stay outside Europe's economic and monetary union (EMU) for a while.</p>
</text>
